      "description": "Plezy is a modern client for Plex, Jellyfin, and Emby, built for high-quality playback, effortless discovery, and offline access. Connect multiple servers at once and enjoy your media in one clean, native app—no subscription required.\n\nBROWSE & DISCOVER\n- Browse libraries, collections, playlists, folders, extras, and personalized recommendations\n- Search across every connected Plex, Jellyfin, and Emby server\n- Explore trending, popular, watchlist, and recommendation rows from Plex Discover, Trakt, MyAnimeList, AniList, Simkl, and Seerr\n- Match catalog titles back to your own libraries and request movies or shows through Seerr\n- See resolution, HDR, Dolby Vision, and audio-format badges at a glance\n\nPLAYBACK\n- Wide codec support including HEVC, AV1, VP9, and more\n- HDR playback, direct play, and configurable transcode quality\n- Switch between media versions with detailed file and stream information\n- Full ASS/SSA subtitles with styling controls and online subtitle search\n- Auto-play the next episode with skip intro and skip credits\n- Chapter navigation, thumbnail scrubbing, playback speed, audio sync, sleep timer, and video zoom\n- Picture-in-Picture, loudness normalization, and stereo downmix with center-channel boost\n- Resume progress and remembered audio/subtitle choices\n\nMUSIC\n- Browse artists, albums, and tracks with rich artwork\n- Gapless playback with a reorderable queue, Play Next, and Add to Queue\n- Synced lyrics, a persistent mini-player, and sleep timer\n- Background playback with lock-screen and media controls\n- Offline albums and tracks, plus selectable streaming quality\n\nLIVE TV & DVR\n- Browse and tune live channels with favorites and a full program guide\n- See what's on, browse show schedules, and manage DVR recording rules\n- Use Live TV across multiple supported servers\n\nDOWNLOADS & OFFLINE\n- Download movies, shows, albums, and tracks\n- Pause or resume the background queue\n- Create automatic download rules, including optional show specials\n- Browse offline and sync watch state when you reconnect\n\nPROFILES & INTEGRATIONS\n- Use multiple profiles with per-profile settings, downloads, and watch state\n- Switch Plex Home users with optional PIN protection\n- Discover Jellyfin and Emby servers locally and use Quick Connect\n- Sync watchlists, ratings, watched state, and scrobbles with connected services\n- Watch together with synchronized play, pause, and seeking\n- Control desktop and TV devices with Plezy Remote\n- Available in English plus 21 translations\n\nSome features require a supported server, media format, or connected service.",
